                    coach_r3_deny:          `<strong>You denied the request during a family-care need.</strong> You've just taught the team that flexibility is a slogan, not a policy — and she's the second parent to feel that this quarter. Expect a third resignation and a €65,000 bill.`,
                    coach_r3_defer:         `<strong>"Ask again after the release."</strong> The care need is now, not in three weeks. Deferring signals flexibility is only for convenient moments — exactly the message that drove the last departure.`,
