                    coach_r4_complementary: `<strong>That's the whole point of the simulation.</strong> Protecting boundaries is how you hit the date AND keep the engineers who ship the next release. The resignation that just cost €65,000 is the proof: ignore wellbeing and output collapses too.`,
                    coach_r4_sequence:      `<strong>"We'll protect wellbeing after the release ships."</strong> But the attrition arrives before "after". Push hard for three weeks on a team already done, and you may hit this date and lose two more engineers — which blows the next release.`,
